<title>UKRAINE: Hryvnia edges up to 1.8320 per dlr in Kiev.</title>
<headline>Hryvnia edges up to 1.8320 per dlr in Kiev.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hryvnia edged up to 1.8320 per dollar on the Ukrainian Interbank Currency Exchange from 1.8330 at the previous session.</p>
<p>					  March 11	   March 7</p>
<p> Hryvnia rate to dollar		1.8320	     1.8330</p>
<p> Volume traded			$2.48 million	  $5.09 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
</text>
